      fontSize: 34
      color: "$white"
      bold: true
      text: 把确定性沉淀到环境，把验证做成闭环
  - elementId: sub
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 268, 800, 60]
    content:
      fontSize: 15
      color: "#D8E4DE"
      lineHeight: 1.65
      text: |
        <p>课后行动：用附录 A 的项目检查表盘点你当前的 Agent 系统——</p>
        <p>Runtime、Context 与 Skill、Tool 与 API、Multi-Agent、Security、WebUI Agent 化，六个维度逐项过一遍。</p>
  - elementId: divider-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [64, 380, 832, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "#3A6E64"}
  - elementId: refs
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 400, 832, 80]
    content:
      fontSize: 11.5
      color: "#A8C2B9"
      lineHeight: 1.7
      text: |
        <p>主要参考：OpenCode Docs · Agent Skills（agentskills.io）· MCP Specification · A2A Protocol · ReAct（arXiv:2210.03629）· GitHub Spec-driven development</p>
